<h1>Contribute to Area 56</h1>
<p class="lede">Group and individual contributions support the work of Area 56 in carrying the message. Thank you for your Seventh Tradition support.</p>

<div class="two-col">
  <section class="panel">
    <h2>By mail</h2>
    <p>Make checks payable to <strong>{{ site.checks_payable_to }}</strong> and mail to:</p>
    <p class="address">{{ site.mailing_address }}</p>
    <p>Please include your group name and G.S.O. service number (if you know it) so your group's contribution can be recorded.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Online</h2>
    {% if site.online_contribution_url %}
    <p>You can contribute online as a group or an individual.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="{{ site.online_contribution_url }}">Contribute online</a></p>
    {% else %}
    <p>Online contributions aren't set up on this site yet. Please contribute by mail for now.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</div>

<p class="small">Also consider contributing to the <a href="https://www.aa.org/contribute">General Service Office</a> and to your district and local intergroup.</p>
